# Product Requirements Document (PRD)

## Product Name
TaskFlow – Smart Task Management Platform

## Overview
TaskFlow is a web and mobile application that helps individuals and teams manage tasks, collaborate effectively, and track project progress in one place.

## Problem Statement
Users struggle to manage tasks across multiple platforms, resulting in missed deadlines, poor collaboration, and reduced productivity.

## Goals
- Improve productivity
- Simplify task management
- Enhance team collaboration
- Provide real-time project tracking

## Target Users
- Students
- Freelancers
- Product Managers
- Small Businesses
- Startup Teams

## Key Features
- User Authentication
- Task Creation & Assignment
- Project Dashboard
- Due Date Reminders
- Team Collaboration
- Notifications
- Progress Tracking
- Analytics Dashboard

## Functional Requirements
- Users can create and edit tasks.
- Users can assign tasks to team members.
- Users receive notifications before deadlines.
- Users can track project progress.
- Users can view productivity analytics.

## Non-Functional Requirements
- Fast loading time
- Secure user authentication
- Mobile responsive
- High availability
- Scalable architecture

## Success Metrics
- 90% task completion rate
- 95% uptime
- Increased daily active users
- Higher customer satisfaction

## Future Enhancements
- AI-powered task prioritization
- Calendar integration
- Slack & Microsoft Teams integration
- Voice commands

## Deliverable
A complete Product Requirements Document defining the product vision, features, requirements, and success metrics.
